(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PROCUREMENT AND MARKETING SUPPORT \(PMS\) SCHEME \(MSME-PMS\) / OFFICE OF DEVELOPMENT COMMISSIONER \(MSME\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Subsidizes participation in national and international trade fairs,) Tj
T*
(marketing exhibitions, and modern retail packaging to enhance market) Tj
T*
(linkage for MSMEs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Registered manufacturing or service MSMEs holding valid Udyam) Tj
T*
(   Registration.) Tj
T*
(2. Participating in approved trade exhibitions, domestic expos, or) Tj
T*
(   onboarding to Government e-Marketplace \(GeM\).) Tj
T*
(3. Special priority given to women, SC/ST, and units in North Eastern) Tj
T*
(   Region.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Up to 100% stall charge reimbursement \(up to Rs. 1.5 Lakh for domestic) Tj
T*
(   expos\) and reimbursement of packaging and barcode certification costs.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 100.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 1.5 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Udyam Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. GST Certificate) Tj
T*
(3. Stall booking receipt and participation certificate from fair organizer) Tj
T*
(4. Bank Account details) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via MSME Champions / PMS Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://champions.gov.in/) Tj
T*
